        {
          "text": "Pele bwami bwa-Roboamu nibwakaima nji, alimwi naakajisi inguzu, wakaleka mulao wa-Jehova, aba-Israyeli boonse mbubonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
