        {
          "text": "Lino Semaya musinsimi wakeza kuli-Roboamu akubami ba-Juda ibakabungene ku-Jerusalemu nkaambo ka-Sisaki, wabaambila kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Inywe mwandileka, aboobo ambebo ndamuleka akumwaaba mumaanza aa-Sisaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
