        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Jehova naakabona kuti balibombya, ijwi lya-Jehova lyakasika kuli-Semaya, liti, Balibombya. Nsikooyoobanyonyoona. Ndabapa lufutuko luniini. Bukali bwangu tabukooyootilwa ku-Jerusalemu kujanza lya-Sisaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
