        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo Sisaki mwami wa-Egepita wakeza kuzoolwisya Jerusalemu, nkabela wakatola zintu ziyandisi zyamuŋanda ya-Jehova, azintu ziyandisi zyamuŋanda yamwami zyoonse wakazitola, Wakatola zikwabilizyo zyangolida nzyaakacita Solomoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
