        {
          "text": "nkabela mwami Roboamu wakapanga zikwabilizyo zyamukuba mucibaka cazyo akuzibika mumaanza aabasilutwe babasilumamba ibakali kulanga mulyango waŋanda yamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.10",
