        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kufumbwa ciindi mwami naakaya kuŋanda ya-Jehova, basilumamba bakainka azyo, elyo kusule basilumamba bakaziboozya kuŋanda yabalindizi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
