        },
        {
          "text": "Aboobo mwami Roboamu wakaliyumya mu-Jerusalemu akweendelezya. Roboamu­ kali amyaka iili makumi one aumwi naakalya bwami, nkabela kali mwami myaka iili ikumi amusanu aibili mu-Jerusalemu, munzi Jehova ngwaakasala akati kamisyobo yoonse ya-Israyeli kuti abike izina lyakwe nkuko. Izina lyabanyina kali Naama mu-Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
