          "text": "Lino makani amwi aa-Roboamu, mataanzi amasyaalizi oonse, sa taalembedwe mubbuku lyamajwi aa-Semaya musinsimi amubbuku lya-Ido sicilengano? Nkabela Roboamu a-Jeroboamu bakali kulwana mazuba oonse. ",
